<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
    <style type="text/css">
      /* Main Table Styles */
      table.blueTable {
        border: 2px solid #2C5282;
        background-color: #F7FAFC;
        width: 90%;
        text-align: left;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      }

      table.blueTable td, 
      table.blueTable th {
        border: 1px solid #CBD5E0;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      table.blueTable tbody td {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      /* Improved alternating row colors */
      table.blueTable tbody tr:nth-child(odd) {
        background: #FFFFFF;
      }

      table.blueTable tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
        background: #EDF2F7;
      }

      /* Modern header design */
      table.blueTable thead {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2D3748 0%, #2C5282 50%, #2B6CB0 100%);
        border-bottom: 3px solid #1A365D;
      }

      table.blueTable thead th {
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #FFFFFF;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      }

      table.blueTable thead th:last-child {
        border-right: none;
      }

      /* Hover effects */
      table.blueTable tbody tr:hover {
        background-color: #E6FFFA !important;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
      }

      /* Nested Table Styles */
      table.nestedTable {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        background: #FFFFFF;
        border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        margin: 8px 0;
        font-size: 13px;
      }

      table.nestedTable thead {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38B2AC 0%, #319795 100%);
        border-bottom: 2px solid #2C7A7B;
      }

      table.nestedTable thead th {
        color: #000000;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      }

      table.nestedTable thead th:last-child {
        border-right: none;
      }

      table.nestedTable tbody td {
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        border-right: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
      }

      table.nestedTable tbody td:last-child {
        border-right: none;
      }

      table.nestedTable tbody tr:nth-child(odd) {
        background: #F7FAFC;
      }

      table.nestedTable tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
        background: #FFFFFF;
      }

      table.nestedTable tbody tr:hover {
        background-color: #E6FFFA !important;
      }

      /* Special styling for bold text */
      .main-item {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #2D3748;
      }

      .nested-item {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #2C7A7B;
      }

      /* Responsive design */
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        table.blueTable {
          font-size: 12px;
        }
        
        table.blueTable td, 
        table.blueTable th {
          padding: 8px 10px;
        }

        table.nestedTable {
          font-size: 11px;
        }

        table.nestedTable td, 
        table.nestedTable th {
          padding: 6px 8px;
        }
      }

      /* Enhanced nested table container */
      .nested-container {
        padding: 16px;
        background: #F1F5F9;
        border-radius: 6px;
        border: 1px solid #CBD5E0;
      }

      .summary-label {
        color: #4A5568;
        font-size: 13px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <h3>Cześć,</h3>
    <p>
      Poniżej znajduje się raport z wykonania próbek w poprzednim miesiącu dla zagranicznych klientów. 
    </p>



    <center>      

      <table class="blueTable">
          <thead>
              <tr>
                  <th>Nazwa</th>
                  <th>Instytucja</th>
                  <th>Od</th>      
                  <th>Do</th>
                  <th>Całkowita Ilość</th>
              </tr>
          </thead>

          <tbody>
              <% @measurement_summaries.each do |ms| %>
                  <tr>
                      <td><span class="main-item"><%= ms.name %></span></td>
                      <td><%= ms.institution.name %></td>
                      <td><%= ms.from_date %></td>        
                      <td><%= ms.to_date %></td>
                      <td><span class="main-item"><%= ms.measurement_summary_items.size %></span></td>
                  </tr>

                  <tr>
                      <td colspan="5">
                          <div class="nested-container">
                              <div class="summary-label">Szczegóły pomiarów:</div>
                              
                              <table class="nestedTable">
                                  <thead>
                                      <tr>
                                          <th>Projekt</th>
                                          <th>Test</th>
                                          <th>Wariant</th>
                                          <th>Ilość</th>
                                      </tr>
                                  </thead>

                                  <tbody>
                                      <% ms.grouped_items.each do |item| %> 
                                          <tr>
                                              <td><span class="nested-item"><%= item.project_name %></span></td>
                                              <td><span class="nested-item"><%= item.test_name %></span></td>
                                              <td><%= item.test_variant %></td>
                                              <td><span class="nested-item"><%= item.volume %></span></td>
                                          </tr>
                                      <% end %>
                                  </tbody>
                              </table>

                          </div>
                      </td>
                  </tr>
              <% end %>
          </tbody>
      </table>

    </center>



    <p>
      Z poważaniem,<br>
      <b>Dział IT</b><br>
      Masdiag Sp. z o.o.<br>
      ul. Stefana Żeromskiego 33<br>
      01–882 Warszawa<br>
      NIP: 522-299-64-68 REGON 146121549 KRS 0000420325<br>
      Sąd Rejonowy dla Miasta Stołecznego Warszawy Wydział XIII KRS, kapitał 6 950 zł w pełni opłacony<br>      
    </p>


    <p>
      Wiadomość wygenerowana automatycznie.
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
